    "text": "familydestinationsguide.com\nwebsite\nGreensboro\nThe Best Pancakes In The South Come From This Unassuming Restaurant In North Carolina\nBy Arthur Hayes,\n3 hours agoIf you’ve ever wondered where breakfast dreams come true in North Carolina, look no further than the humble building on South Regional Road in Greensboro. Carolina’s Diner doesn’t announce itself with flashy signs or gimmicks—it simply delivers plate after plate of what might be the most perfect pancakes south of the Mason-Dixon line.",
